DTSTAMP:20260822T232238Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260723
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Air Plan Approval\; Maine\; Chapter 140: Part
  70 Air Emission License Regulation
DESCRIPTION:The Environmental Protection Agency (EPA) is approving a Clean
  Air Act (CAA) operating permit program revision submitted by the State of
  Maine. This revision makes minor changes to Maine's operating permit prog
 ram that are considered clarifications\, that correct grammar\, that codif
 y longstanding practices\, or that are necessary for the state to utilize 
 an expected future electronic application system. The revisions also inclu
 de provisions allowing the public comment period on a draft permit to run 
 concurrently with the EPA's review of a proposed permit. The intended effe
 ct of this action is to approve Maine's revisions. This action is being ta
 ken in accordance with the Clean Air Act.\nhttps://www.federalregister.gov
 /documents/2026/07/23/2026-14885/air-plan-approval-maine-chapter-140-part-
 70-air-emission-license-regulation
URL:https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/07/23/2026-14885/air-pl
 an-approval-maine-chapter-140-part-70-air-emission-license-regulation
